      "name": "Primary Filled Button",
      "role": "Main call-to-action",
      "description": "Charcoal (#222834) background, white text, 24px border-radius, 7px/16px padding, GT Standard M 14–15px medium. Carries the signature two-layer soft shadow: rgba(34,40,52,0.05) 0 4px 10px and rgba(34,40,52,0.04) -2px 18px 18px. The shadow is what lifts the button off the page without using a hard border."
