      "name": "Ghost / Outlined Button",
      "role": "Secondary action",
      "description": "Transparent or Paper background with a 1px Hairline (#e5e7eb) border, Ink (#14171f) text, 24px radius, same 7px/16px padding as the filled variant. Used for lower-emphasis actions where a filled Charcoal would be too loud."
